  "fields": {
    "title": "Digital Reading",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Digital reading is the activity of reading a book or an article using an electronic device like a laptop, smartphone, tablet or eBook reader. In the",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2UW89qDSRswAxAafyMOYWX",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": " post-digital age",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ", digital reading is the new norm. Not only the medium on which text is read has changed, also the reading behaviour. Digital reading mainly consists of browsing, glancing over, checking, and identifying key words.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1WH09wwl3PU4o0hWLcnAXR",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[1]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " Reading is selective, things are not read more than once, and it is generally non-linear. It is said to be at the expense of concentrated and in-depth reading.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1ZGqtvJZxz6866DV4PyK1J",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[2]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " Some say that this transitory reading behaviour even influences our cognitive abilities.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1WH09wwl3PU4o0hWLcnAXR",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[1]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Reading on the Web seems to encourage skimming. While useful as a technique to identify quickly items of interest in the mass of available content, it can become a disadvantage when working with complex digital literary forms.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1FS829ZV2HF6BPeuosJx7j",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[3]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " But the web and ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "3yOBecAoV11TC0Y5c4tReo",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "hypertext",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " also make new literary forms possible, like ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7GUBum8whRrLTaVAKoQAGr",
                    "type": "Link",
